grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v31","updateDate":"2022-10-21T14:50:36.791Z","correctionNotice":"Due to system issues the UK Economic Accounts published on the 30th September 2022 the General Government consumption of fixed capital series (NMXO) time series data was not published for the time periods 2021 annually and 2021 Quarter 1 onwards. This has now been rectified.","label":"v31"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v32","updateDate":"2022-11-10T13:00:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"Due to system issues some balance of payments and gross fixed capital formation data within the UK Economic Accounts time series dataset published on the 30th September 2022 were incorrectly populated. This has now been updated with data consistent with Pink and Blue Books 2022.","label":"v32"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v33","updateDate":"2022-12-22T09:30:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"","label":"v33"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v34","updateDate":"2023-02-14T09:30:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"","label":"v34"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v35","updateDate":"2023-03-31T08:30:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"","label":"v35"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v36","updateDate":"2023-05-04T11:12:36.090Z","correctionNotice":"","label":"v36"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v37","updateDate":"2023-06-30T08:30:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"","label":"v37"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v38","updateDate":"2023-09-29T08:30:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"","label":"v38"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v39","updateDate":"2023-10-10T08:30:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"","label":"v39"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v40","updateDate":"2023-10-23T14:00:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"Because of processing issues, the calculation of the statistical discrepancy of net lending (+) and net borrowing (-) between financial and capital accounts was not calculated correctly for the time period 1987 to 1997 in the Quarter 2 (Apr to June) 2023 release. This has now been rectified and the tables and data are now available. The series affected are as follows.\n\n-  NYVK: United Kingdom (S1)\n\n-  NYOY: Financial corporations except monetary financial institutions and insurance corporations and pension funds (S124 to S127)\n\n-  NYPB: Insurance corporations and pension funds (S128 \u0026 S129)\n\n-  NYOX: Financial corporations (S12)\n\n-  NZDW: Central government (S1311)\n\n-  NYOZ: General government (S13)\n\n-  NYPA: Households (S14)\n\n-  NYPH: Non-profit institutions serving households (S15)\n\n-  NZDV: Households and Non-profit institutions serving households (S14 and S15)\n\nAll series are £million. current price, not seasonally adjusted\n\nWe apologise for any inconvenience caused.","label":"v40"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v41","updateDate":"2023-11-06T07:51:51.257Z","correctionNotice":"We have identified and corrected an error relating to several gross fixed capital formation series for the time period 1987 to 1996 in the Quarter 2 (Apr to June) 2023 release. The series affected are as follows - \n\n- DFDK: Dwellings\n- DLXI: ICT equipment and other machinery and equipment\n- DLXP: Intellectual property products\n\nWe apologise for any inconvenience caused.  ","label":"v41"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v42","updateDate":"2023-12-22T09:30:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"","label":"v42"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v43","updateDate":"2024-03-28T09:30:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"","label":"v43"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v44","updateDate":"2024-04-02T12:36:01.872Z","correctionNotice":"There was an error with a number of series for Quarter 1 (Jan to Mar) 2023 onwards because of a processing issue. We have since corrected this error. We sincerely apologise for any inconvenience.","label":"v44"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v45","updateDate":"2024-06-28T08:30:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"","label":"v45"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v46","updateDate":"2024-09-30T08:30:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"","label":"v46"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v47","updateDate":"2024-12-23T09:30:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"","label":"v47"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v48","updateDate":"2025-03-28T09:30:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"","label":"v48"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v49","updateDate":"2025-06-30T08:30:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"","label":"v49"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v50","updateDate":"2025-07-08T10:30:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"We have corrected an error that meant that low level quarterly data within this output were incorrect for the period 1997-2019 for current price (CP) data with annual data unaffected. This does not impact on the total trade aggregate series and has no impact on total GDP. We apologise for any inconvenience caused.","label":"v50"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v51","updateDate":"2025-09-30T08:30:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"","label":"v51"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v52","updateDate":"2025-10-03T14:16:11.563Z","correctionNotice":"We have corrected an error with dataset identifiers MWB6, MWB7 and CRSF and their associated growth rates in Table 1.1.5B of our UK Economic Accounts dataset, published on 30 September 2025. This happened because of a processing issue. \n\nWe apologise for any inconvenience caused.","label":"v52"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v53","updateDate":"2025-10-13T11:09:38.653Z","correctionNotice":"We have corrected an error in this dataset, affecting only the values for services exports to EU and non-EU in 2024 and 2025. There is no impact on total services export or import values. We apologise for any inconvenience caused.","label":"v53"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v54","updateDate":"2025-11-14T09:30:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"A number of legacy time series relating to historical gross fixed capital formation (GFCF) for the period 1987 to 1996 were unintentionally included in the UK Economic Accounts dataset. These series have now been removed to maintain consistency with previous practice on pre-1997 data content. We apologise for this correction.","label":"v54"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v54","updateDate":"2025-11-14T09:30:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"A number of legacy time series relating to historical gross fixed capital formation (GFCF) for the period 1987 to 1996 were unintentionally included in the UK Economic Accounts dataset. These series have now been removed to maintain consistency with previous practice on pre-1997 data content. We apologise for this correction.","label":"v54"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v55","updateDate":"2025-12-22T09:30:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"","label":"v55"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v56","updateDate":"2026-01-16T09:30:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"A processing error has been identified in the calculation of four indices\u0027 published values, from 2024 to the latest.\n\nOSXR - Real Households\u0027 and NPISH disposable income: Index (reference year 2023 \u003d 100) Not seasonally adjusted\n\nOSXS - Real Households\u0027 and NPISH disposable income: Index (reference year 2023 \u003d 100) Seasonally adjusted\n\nDG2Z - Real Households\u0027 disposable income: Index (reference year 2023 \u003d 100) Not seasonally adjusted\n\nDG43 - Real Households\u0027 disposable income: Index (reference year 2023 \u003d 100) Seasonally adjusted\n\nThese have now been corrected. We apologise for this error.\n\nPlease note: Data for 2023 onwards for these series were also affected by the same processing error for the following earlier editions of the dataset, which have not been corrected: July to September 2024, October to December 2024, and January to March 2025. Please use the most recent dataset if you are interested in these series.","label":"v56"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v57","updateDate":"2026-02-03T07:24:39.324Z","correctionNotice":"We have corrected a processing error in the Consumer trends time series dataset affecting chained volume estimates and the associated growths for the data period of 1985 to 1997. \n\nThe series with the Classification of Individual Consumption According to Purpose (COICOP) codes and associated aggregate series 03.1.2, 03.2.2, 04.1.2, 04.4.2, 05.1.3, 07.1.1, 07.2.2, 08.2, 09.1.2, 09.1.3, 11.1.1, 12.1.2, have been updated. All other series and data periods from 1998 onwards are unaffected. \n\nWe apologise for this correction.","label":"v57"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v58","updateDate":"2026-03-31T06:00:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"","label":"v58"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v59","updateDate":"2026-06-30T06:00:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"","label":"v59"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v59","updateDate":"2026-06-30T06:00:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"","label":"v59"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v60","updateDate":"2026-07-03T08:30:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"","label":"v60"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v61","updateDate":"2026-09-30T06:00:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"","label":"v61"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v61","updateDate":"2026-09-30T06:00:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"","label":"v61"},{"uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea/previous/v61","updateDate":"2026-09-30T06:00:00.000Z","correctionNotice":"","label":"v61"}],"type":"timeseries","uri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/timeseries/nisu/ukea","description":{"title":"Households (S.14): UK central government securities (AF.32N11): Level: Asset: Current price: £million: NSA","contact":{"email":"sector.accounts@ons.gov.uk","name":"Sector Accounts team","telephone":"+44 1633 456366"},"releaseDate":"2026-09-29T23:00:00.000Z","nextRelease":"22 December 2026","datasetId":"UKEA","datasetUri":"/economy/grossdomesticproductgdp/datasets/unitedkingdomeconomicaccounts","cdid":"NISU","unit":"","preUnit":"","source":"","date":"2026 Q2","number":"2687","sampleSize":"0"}}